## Allowed values

- `Status`: `answerable` · `needs-data` · `not-modelled`
- `Gap type`: `modelling` · `data` · `—`

**Hyphenated, exactly.** `needs data` with a space counts toward the total and
toward no bucket, silently, which reads as coverage nobody has.

## Coverage

Derived at derive time — **do not maintain by hand.**


